pbx3 (0.0.3-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * idpwgen: introduce Go binary for shortuid and password generation (single
    source for pbx3 and pbx3api). Shortuids: 6 chars, charset without
    vowels/similar; passwords: 12 chars with override charset.
  * HelperClass: generate() now uses idpwgen only; add idpwgenPath(),
    runIdpwgen(); path from config.php constant IDPWGEN.
  * dumper.php: update "existing shortuid" regex to 6 chars and idpwgen
    charset (^[0-9bcdfghjkmnpqrstvwxyz]{6}$) so previously issued shortuids
    are not overwritten.
  * Packaging: add golang-go to Depends; build idpwgen at install in
    installer.sh only (do not ship binary); add compiled binary to
    .gitignore.
  * Documentation: add idpwgen section to PHP_SCRIPTS_AND_MODULES.md; add
    workingdocs/IDPWGEN_ROLLOUT_PLAN.md.

