pbx3 (0.0.2-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Backend-only split completed: removed Apache/HTTP ownership from pbx3;
    API web stack is owned by pbx3api (nginx + PHP-FPM).
  * Installer hardening and portability updates: POSIX sh compatibility,
    manual idempotent run model, instance FQDN prompt/env support, hostname
    and /etc/hosts updates, and one-shot setip execution.
  * Packaging/runtime updates: add php-cli and php-sqlite3 dependencies for
    installer/setip scripts; remove legacy debsetlan systemd service flow.
  * Database/bootstrap fixes: reloader now ensures db_database_dumps exists;
    remove sqlite_sequence from laravel schema to avoid SQLite reserved table
    conflicts.
  * Network/service reliability updates: ensure /etc/shorewall6 is created
    when needed, keep shipped shorewall inline FQDN template comment-only,
    and use mysql socket auth for CDR bootstrap.
  * TLS/LE workflow integration in backend scripts: add first-issue, renew,
    and open/close-port-80 helpers with apply-active-cert path for nginx and
    Asterisk certificate activation.

